Third-party attribution
-----------------------

The binaries and the application bundle contain third-party Rust crates and npm
packages under their own licenses (MIT, Apache-2.0, MPL-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib,
Unicode and others). THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md lists every one with its license,
names the MPL-2.0 components and where their source is, and carries each
license text. It is generated from the lockfiles by tools/third-party.py and
installed beside LICENSE by every package.
